Z||000000||SloPonti||09-18-2000||12:33 AM||||well i got new wheels for the hopped up iron duck! check out link for picture! they are z24 calavlier wheels with 205/55/16 yokahama tires on them-they stick like glue!!! i got them on today and took them auto crossing! i was in CSP N class! the n is for novice-were i live you have to race in novice class three times before you can race the regular class! we had five cars in the class the two cars that beat me were a 1997 LT1 forumula and a 95 mustang V8! there times were in the 46 second range and i was a constant 47 all day long-I BEAT A MR2 and a Saturn! i was feeling pretty good! also there was a cavalier club there with about 10-12 z24 there and they were in the 43 to 46 range! so the hopped up iron duck did pretty good! well check out some pictures and let me know what you think of the wheels! i will post some more pictures of autox to! thanks and by the way my old custom wheels will be for sale! email me for info! <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/boatr502/wheel1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/boatr502/wheel1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/boatr502/wheel2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/boatr502/wheel2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/boatr502/racing.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/boatr502/racing.jpg</A> <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by SloPonti (edited 09-18-2000).]||||reg||14
